          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time your opponent spends any rage dice as part of the &apos;Eruption of Fury&apos; ability, after that ability has been resolved, if this unit is not in combat, it can move up to **X**D6&quot;, where **X** is the number of rage dice spent. It cannot end that move in combat.</characteristic>
