            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">• This unit can use **^^Unbind^^** and **^^Banish^^** abilities as if it had **^^Wizard (1)^^**.
• Add 1 to the number of dice rolled when making unbinding rolls and banishment rolls for this unit, to a maximum of 3.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
